      "text_preview": "10. On going through the materials, it could be seen that 12.04.2023 at about 9.25 p.m., petitioner was riding TVS Moped bearing Reg. No. KA-50-W-2046 slowly and cautiously by following all traffic rules and regulations by observing on movi"
