        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The negligence in common parlance means and simply failure to exercise due care, expected of a reasonable prudent person."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bebaf43ff3a14618818ee572bfe9c201_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is a breach of duty and negligence in law ranging from an advertence to shameful disregard of safety of others."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "13e97107f13f414094495ca9c25af1f2_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In most instances, it is caused or heedlessness or inadvertence, by which the negligent party is unaware of the results, which may follow from his act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bbeb2ee71bf848af83f2fcfc4c4e59bd_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNegligence is that, a breach of duty or lack of probable care in doing something."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "13468af61fbc40df834a38bcf4f5b570_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In short, it is want of attention and doing of something, which a prudent and reasonable man would not do."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2643c31db3af40f288e62f864aa207d1_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The burden is upon the petitioner to prove that, the accident occurred due to negligent riding of the rider of motorcycle bearing Reg. No. KA-13-EV-4959.\n12."
    },
