    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2aa007200e5149ce9ba5bb522ec0180c_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "So, in the absence of any evidence in respect of the income of the petitioner,\nthe petitioner might have monthly income at Rs.16,000/- as per the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka fixed notional income of the year 2023 at Rs.16,000/- per mont"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14b4b26c6d4e4fd0972012a2ad1315a1_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The accident is of the year is 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "81dcdeedcf234ef4a30d86f9221542d0_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, the income of the petitioner is considered as Rs.16,000/-p.m. as per above decision."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d8e7165b119147a1bb73272cdce87721_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, 2 months is to be considered as loss of income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b7176688c512496297d0d323e36a433f_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled for compensation of Rs.32,000/- under this head."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6167f362dca94a2f8b5fbca092a5cc49_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. Towards loss of future earning capacity on account of Permanent Physical Disability-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "edcb34d043ff4e7a909a6526704347d5_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner to prove his disability, he has produced the evidence of Dr. Mahesh. V in order to substantiate the same, PW.2 who has opined that, total physical disability of left lower limb at 39.75%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f2e0dd87bab540f9ba6cf21bd06cba92_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the PW.2 is a treated doctor."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "566632deb4684aeb94d6ce00b1c4d129_91",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact of matter is that, claimant has suffered physical disability of left lower limb at 39.75% and the doctor opine that, claimant is having difficulties in walking, sitting and climbing stairs."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9afc8a7a98b14f8db7988f74bd07b811_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further he also opine that, he walks with limping gait."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6fcfeb0f88af44e8831f45fbc6d919d7_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, normally in such circumstances Tribunal will consider 1/3rd of the disability while calculating loss of future earnings."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cded02d2f0f449e281d92eb5d54c3002_94",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, looking to the nature of the injuries it is proper to came to conclusion that there is 13.25% of disability to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "159b4110892a41d1ba3f056922fe1d4c_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "21. Before proceeding on merits of the claim the age of the petitioner /injured has to be determined."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa9ff38727614e7b99618e7956dc243f_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nEx.P.14 is the Aadhar Card of the petitioner, wherein his DOB is mentioned as 11.01.1958 and accident took place in the year 2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f52167c950704eb8a49f317e4edad075_97",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, I assess his age as 65 years at the time of this accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "632054ee6b0a43b5873bfdfb5dce4348_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the ruling reported in AIR 2009 SCW page-3014 between SARLA VERAMA AND OTHERS VS DELHI TRANSPORT CORPORATION AND OTHERS, the relevant multiplier applicable is '7'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3e577424a4eb4065b777b4cd28223f33_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence Rs.16,000 X 12 X 7 X 13.25% = 1,78,080/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cd830b9127584876bfbb1d57647d6ed3_100",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under this head the petitioner is entitled for an amount of Rs.1,78,080/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ff11ef8298d42c483e1aaeff7d6e04a_101",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. FOOD, CONVEYANCE, NOURISHMENT AND ATTENDANT CHARGES:\nFurther the petitioner has sustained grievous injuries and took treatment as inpatient in Punya Hospital, Hassan as inpatient from 12.04.2023 to 22.04.2023 i.e., for 10 days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7627634fd8c94ab78c76145afa6335e8_102",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he is entitled for compensation of Rs.30,000/- under the head of nutritious food and attendant charges."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "08e65f827f314caba9ad426b3c5333cf_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. LOSS OF FUTURE AMENITIES AND HAPPINESS :"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "de25ae0393734b0388f15f3462ba4ffe_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner was aged about 65 years at the time of accident, he has sustained grievous injuries."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c2a55660dc844532a833cab7407035b3_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It shows that he found difficulty in doing day to day works."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "802fca45a57a466fb6fd180df3c5d62a_106",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He might have suffered lot of pain and loss of amenities and comforts in life."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f664fa85810f4af68b67deda5df129a9_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, considering the age, nature of injuries and percentage of disability, Rs.50,000/- is Balaraj A vs Sanjay S N on 29 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/174178886/\n6 awarded under the head of loss of future a"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c6f325b49c254a67aa92655da48b5dc5_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, the petitioner is entitled for total compensation under the following heads:\n1 Pain and sufferings Rs. 50,000/-\n2 Medical expenses Rs. 1,80,479/-\n3 Loss of earnings during laid Rs. 32,000/-\nup period 4 Loss of future earning, Rs. 1,"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7b9007b5c874ec0994ac7a68a2d92b4_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "attendant charges 6 Loss of future amenities and Rs. 50,000/-\nhappiness Total Rs. 5,20,559/-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4043a412f85943f5934fb414b7b396be_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, the petitioner is entitled for total compensation of Rs. 5,20,559/- under various heads."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8f7bff298a4b43a194de3046a2c3e7b5_111",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. LIABILITY: As discussed in issue No.1, the accident was occurred due to rash and negligent riding by the rider of motorcycle bearing Reg. No. KA-13-EV-4959 and the police have conducted due enquiry and filed charge sheet against the sai"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9315ceb314704491b7135813bd331efa_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From perusal of the policy, the offending vehicle was insured with the respondent No.1 for the period from 06.12.2022 to 05.12.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "53475d919a8642eaaf3d77b0e9f709e8_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Admittedly, the accident in question took place on 12.04.2023."
